<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered prices on lean slaughter hogs were $1.00 lower than Thursday's close. -USDA</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) -</p>
<p>-- 50-52 percent lean, carcass weight of 171-195 lbs</p>
<p>	 74.92-77.93</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 1,200</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
